 *
 * "Set a New Password" form (from the reset email).
 *
 * - Adds the form_key stock omits (ResetPasswordPost requires it).
 * - Dropped: validation/passwordStrengthIndicator/show-password widgets and
 *   the empty Knockout "Show Password" placeholder. The static strength label
 *   stays (it doesn't update without JS).
 *
 * @var \Magento\Customer\Block\Account\Resetpassword $block
